{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1031","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Curiosity Has No Limits"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"When Masha came to math classes today, she saw two integer sequences of length $$$n - 1$$$ on the blackboard. Let's denote the elements of the first sequence as $$$a_i$$$ ($$$0 \\le a_i \\le 3$$$), and the elements of the second sequence as $$$b_i$$$ ($$$0 \\le b_i \\le 3$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Masha became interested if or not there is an integer sequence of length $$$n$$$, which elements we will denote as $$$t_i$$$ ($$$0 \\le t_i \\le 3$$$), so that for every $$$i$$$ ($$$1 \\le i \\le n - 1$$$) the following is true: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$a_i = t_i | t_{i + 1}$$$ (where $$$|$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#OR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise OR operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":") and "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$b_i = t_i \\& t_{i + 1}$$$ (where $$$\\&$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#AND"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bitwise AND operation"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":"). "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The question appeared to be too difficult for Masha, so now she asked you to check whether such a sequence $$$t_i$$$ of length $$$n$$$ exists. If it exists, find such a sequence. If there are multiple such sequences, find any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 10^5$$$) — the length of the sequence $$$t_i$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n - 1$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_{n-1}$$$ ($$$0 \\le a_i \\le 3$$$) — the first sequence on the blackboard."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains $$$n - 1$$$ integers $$$b_1, b_2, \\ldots, b_{n-1}$$$ ($$$0 \\le b_i \\le 3$$$) — the second sequence on the blackboard."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first line print \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes), if there is a sequence $$$t_i$$$ that satisfies the conditions from the statements, and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" (without quotes), if there is no such sequence."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there is such a sequence, on the second line print $$$n$$$ integers $$$t_1, t_2, \\ldots, t_n$$$ ($$$0 \\le t_i \\le 3$$$) — the sequence that satisfies the statements conditions."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are multiple answers, print any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n3 3 2\n1 2 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"YES\n1 3 2 0 "}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n1 3\n3 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"NO"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example it's easy to see that the sequence from output satisfies the given conditions: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$t_1 | t_2 = (01_2) | (11_2) = (11_2) = 3 = a_1$$$ and $$$t_1 \\& t_2 = (01_2) \\& (11_2) = (01_2) = 1 = b_1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$t_2 | t_3 = (11_2) | (10_2) = (11_2) = 3 = a_2$$$ and $$$t_2 \\& t_3 = (11_2) \\& (10_2) = (10_2) = 2 = b_2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$t_3 | t_4 = (10_2) | (00_2) = (10_2) = 2 = a_3$$$ and $$$t_3 \\& t_4 = (10_2) \\& (00_2) = (00_2) = 0 = b_3$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example there is no such sequence."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1031B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1031/problem/B"}